1. Project Scope
The quotation includes only the features and functionalities specifically mentioned in the proposal. Any additional features or changes requested after project approval will be quoted separately.

2. Third-Party Services
This quotation does not include any third-party API charges, subscription fees, or licensing costs, including but not limited to AI services, WhatsApp Business API, SMS gateways, email services, payment gateways, maps, or any other external service.

3.API Development
Third-party API integration and custom API development are not included in this quotation. If required in the future, they will be quoted separately.

4. Payment Terms
50% Advance payment is required before the project starts.
50% Balance payment is due immediately after the project is completed and made live.', 71500, 12870, 84370, '2026-07-18 09:59:56');
